                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Thank you for yout review! It was very thorough, and we really appreciate the feedback! As for the story, we are saving that for a while. Right now we are focusing on getting the tech to work as flawlessly as possible, so that we have a solid foundation to layer our stories on in each episode.\n\nWe look forward to seeing what you think of the game as we get closer to the finished product.",
